// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2444852298" "I'm sure you're aware of the great threat that Praetorian Earth poses to our dimension, {HeroName}. Portal Corporation has been doing everything it can to combat that threat. Through the efforts of our hero liaisons, several of the Praetorians were incarcerated; however, an extradimensional event at the Zig recently freed the lot of  them. That fact makes me all the more nervous about the following development: <br><br>Recently we asked some heroes to plant data scanners on a pack of war wolves on Praetorian Earth. The scanners' primary purpose was to keep us appraised of the Praetorians' efforts to enter our dimension, but they have also been providing us with valuable information on troop movements, technological advances, and shifts of power within the Praetorian world itself. One of the scanners stopped transmitting just this morning. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get to Praetorian Earth and fix that scanner.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1213791814" "Fix the scanner"
// SendOffString :
"P3324694894" "When the scanner went dead, it was somewhere in the abandoned graveyard I'm sending you to."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1639665361" "Find the dead scanner"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1943746899" "I need to know the status of that data scanner."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P667641708" "As you step into this abandoned graveyard on Praetorian Earth, you feel certain you're being watched."
// Script Variable MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3264121797" "Swift death!"
// Script Variable MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3444105954" "Defend yourself!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1555333671" "<shout>We will have our revenge!"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2858058657" "You will fall before us!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3910612068" "Chimera"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4087003577" "The wolf I butchered will lead the heroes right to us. Of that I am certain."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2502988453" "You will watch us no longer!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Chimera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1697288412" "Defeat Chimera"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1078620625" "Chimera was clutching a dead Portal Corporation scanner."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - WolfBones 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2266061477" "Wolf bones"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2984616034" "You begin to examine the bones."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2557807414" "You have been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2422657657" "You have examined the bones."
// InteractActionString :
"P1412195360" "Examining..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1291797473" "The data scanner has been hacked from the body of this war wolf."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3044042556" "You found the data scanner."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P635826832" "Chimera butchered that war wolf, just to lay a trap for you. I have to admit, that turns my stomach. I guess it shows us the kind of villains we're dealing with. Don't go too far, {HeroName}. I have the feeling that the Praetorians will require more of you attention. And soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P3127330658" "Maria Jenkins trusts {HeroName} to deal with the Praetorians."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2109377300" "You remember those data scanners we planted on Praetorian Earth? The last time we spoke I was worried because one of them had gone dead; now, they're all dead! We've stopped receiving any signals from the scanners whatsoever. This doesn't sit right with me, {HeroName}. It could be that the Praetorians eliminated the scanners because they're about to begin work on something they don't want us to observe. Plans for an invasion, perhaps? I wouldn't be surprised. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go back to Shadowhunter's forest and check on those scanners.</A> See if you can confirm my suspicions. <br><br>But do it quickly. If those scanners have been compromised, we could be in danger of the Praetorians using them against us! I've only received authorization for a 1 hour excursion."
// AcceptString :
"P454177730" "Check on the scanners"
// SendOffString :
"P3643170844" "If the Praetorians are plotting something, I need you to learn everything you can."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3224457932" "Defeat all wolves in area"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1315135034" "We still don't know what's going on why all those data scanners went dead. {HeroName}, I'm really worried!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P90073729" "Something moves in the underbrush. You're not alone here."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P2644990723" "Grarrr!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P800637379" "Grooowwwrr!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2888469689" "Shadowhunter"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3591291884" "Tonight we will exact our revenge upon {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3049661966" "I have culled the infected creatures from my pack. My brothers will not serve as your spies!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2393008336" "When you defeated Shadowhunter, he spat out, 'Your foul machines have been given to the metallic abominations.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P513985269" "You've received a signal from Maria Jenkins. Your time on Praetorian Earth is up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2732526518" "So, the scanners were given to Siege and Nightstar. I think we'd better stay on this course, {HeroName}. I'm afraid it's leading us toward something big."
// RandomFameString :
"P3175891299" "{HeroName} is Portal Corporations' right-hand hero!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1591126052" "While you were gone, Portal Corporation managed to get a bead on the residual signal from those scanners. The data's fuzzy, but it seems likely they're some sort of facility on Praetorian Earth, rumored to be under the control of the villain Siege. I hate to send you in there, {HeroName}. But I think I have to."
// RandomFameString :
"P2620314338" "I hear {HeroName} wasn't able to get the better of Shadowhunter! I can hardly believe it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3729344680" "We've found the location of a storage facility operated by Siege and Nightstar. There's a good chance our missing data scanners may be there. I think it's important that we track down those data scanners, {HeroName}; I don't want to see Portal Corporation tech in the hands of the Praetorians. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to infiltrate that facility and bring back the missing scanners.</A> Can you do that?"
// AcceptString :
"P534214966" "Bring back the missing scanners"
// SendOffString :
"P2020721668" "Those scanners were  built with state of the art technology. There's no telling what Siege and his minions can learn from them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2932932476" "Defeat Siege and his minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2830127319" "We need every last scanner back, {HeroName}. I won't see that technology left in the Praetorians' hands."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3919211657" "Siege's enormous facility is staffed by scores of mechanized men. You'll have to fight your way through them to locate the missing scanners."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3964876210" "Nightstar"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3394544656" "Maintain a tight patrol. Siege is concerned about invaders!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P357907501" "I have more than enough power to deal with you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1476172860" "Siege"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1286937734" "I'm told that the scanners have proved most illuminating."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2407577745" "How dare you invade my world?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4105117061" "Computer"
// Description :
"P742053959" "Find the scanners"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3348388328" "You begin to access the computer."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P804164300" "You have accessed the computer."
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4064178660" "You found a transfer order."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P411101221" "You learned where the scanners are being stored."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3874247508" "It sounds like the Praetorians are hard at work learning all they can about Portal Corporation's data scanners. They might be trying to reverse engineer them, or even adapt them to some nefarious purpose. We've got to get those scanners back!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1379051043" "I hear the Praetorian androids can't stand up to {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1642865178" "From what you learned at Siege's storage facility, it seems that Portal Corporation's data scanners are being held at one of Neuron's labs. Portal Corporation already knows the location of one of those labs. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go to Praetorian Earth and get those data scanners back.</A> While you're there, see if you can find out what the Praetorians hope to gain by studying them."
// AcceptString :
"P2652011638" "Get the data scanners back"
// SendOffString :
"P2573549678" "If you manage to get any of the scanners back, take them over to Tina Macintyre at Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4167392846" "Defeat Bobcat and her minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2080335648" "We need those data scanners, {HeroName}. Every minute we lose is another minute Neuron has to examine them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4010079349" "You hear a sound that strangely resembles a purr."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2714437673" "If that pesky {HeroName} invades, Bobcat will flay us alive!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1843003529" "No worries. We can take {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3909108572" "Bobcat"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2895508385" "Don't relax your guard for a minute."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3079170960" "If {HeroName} escapes, Neuron will show us no mercy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scanners 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
