"P1743867049" "You found the data scanners!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P205828099" "You defeated Bobcat and retrieved the data scanners."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P634013693" "Take scanners to Tina Macintyre"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P686848622" "Tina can tell us more about how those scanners were modified."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2906046487" "Now that we've got an idea of how the data scanners were modified, I should be able to remotely activate the scanners that were sent to Neuron's second lab. Then we can pinpoint its location and send you in to determine his purpose. Right off the bat, I can tell you that his adaptation of our technology is most advanced. I'd say he's up to something pretty serious."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound4_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2243043668" "Defeat Neuron and his minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P496756932" "We need to know what Neuron is playing at!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3699374160" "The sweat on the back of your neck chills you as you step into the climate-controlled lab."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P267233015" "Neuron"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2015331616" "Has the Statesman become more talkative?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2303263514" "You will not invade my lab!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scanners2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P625195535" "You found the remaining scanners, along with some disturbing research notes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P480797583" "Seek clues"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1163322877" "You intercepted a message to Neuron."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2373062471" "You defeated Neuron and learned that Statesman has been imprisoned."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P923604361" "The Praetorians have Statesman captive! How can this be? This is huge, {HeroName}, this is colossal! We've got to do everything in our power to rescue Statesman from those fiends. Maybe that message you from Warrior Earth can help us. I'll look into it directly."
// RandomFameString :
"P1894127131" "{HeroName} said the Praetorians have Statesman!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3312236422" "Statesman is in the hands of the Praetorians, and we have to follow every lead that might help us effect his escape. I'm hoping that the message you intercepted from Warrior Earth can be one such lead. The warrior clan was willing to pledge allegiance to Neuron for help against the conquering Battle Maiden. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It could be that if you go to Warrior Earth and defend that clan from Battle Maiden, they might be willing to help you instead.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2521659111" "Defend the Warrior clan from Battle Maiden"
// SendOffString :
"P4247949872" "Battle Maiden's persuasive tactics lean heavily toward the brutal. According to that message, she plans to bomb the clan's village if they don't give in to her demands."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P77236769" "Save Warrior clan's village"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1777479157" "I need you to see what you can learn from that Warrior clan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2285846783" "The sound of steel on steel quickens your heartbeat."
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3926245313" "Return Kawago to us!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1678697333" "You come with Battle Maiden? You shall die!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2202383740" "Kawago will pay the price for defying Battle Maiden!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2140400178" "Do not interfere!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2805183479" "Gentay"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2236449173" "Our clan elder must be returned!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1486972719" "No one invades our land!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P427837069" "Cpl. Jitoy"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3417455261" "Accede to Battle Maiden's wishes, and Kawago will be returned, almost as good as new."
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3956269078" "This land is claimed by Battle Maiden. Leave immediately, or die!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1520036547" "Kolaga"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3422197688" "Your fancy technology is no match for our raw steel and skill!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2102309358" "Another invader! Attack!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P898987488" "Lt. Kentow"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P933460366" "Do not delude yourself. You cannot best Battle Maiden's weaponry."
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1781862154" "No one will interfere with this recruitment!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3265997721" "You are kidnappers! You have no honor!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P387403765" "Have you taken Kawago?"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4132856125" "We did what was necessary to make you see the light."
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3367490760" "This is Battle Maiden's territory. Surrender!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P140605230" "Yatima"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P289524753" "If our clan elder is not returned, Battle Maiden will feel our wrath!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P84939227" "This is our battle!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2868174875" "Gen. Kantai"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3720313765" "Kawago will be returned only if you comply."
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1344297875" "Leave, or be destroyed with these peasants!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3887067674" "For Kawago!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2601722307" "Leave us be!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3006396652" "For Battle Maiden!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3413325986" "Surrender!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bombs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2020931920" "Bomb"
// Description :
"P1759974460" "bombs to defuse"
// SingularDescription :
"P1281026055" "Defuse the last bomb!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3187633429" "You begin to defuse the bomb."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P793360896" "You have defused the bomb."
// InteractActionString :
"P557407609" "Defusing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2923707714" "You defused the bomb and learned that Kawago, the warrior clan's elder, was kidnapped by Battle Maiden."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3269832233" "Take defused bomb to Tina"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P969732820" "Tina may be able to trace the dimensional signature of that bomb. Then we can follow Battle Maiden to her hideout."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P842505933" "Back again, {HeroName}. Yes, I believe I can trace the dimensional signature of this bomb. It originated on Praetorian Earth, that's to be expected. Oh! It looks like the bomb can be traced to a network of caverns deep within the Praetorians' world. If you're looking for Battle Maiden, I recommend starting there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1144550080" "Defeat Battle Maiden & her minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3850979870" "If we rescue their clan leader, that Warrior clan may be a little more receptive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4150978472" "The caverns' air is ice cold; little thought is given to comfort in Battle Maiden's domain."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1876743934" "Battle Maiden"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P540677820" "Kawago will see what it means to defy me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P667806823" "You can die with Kawago, for all I care!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Kawago 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2767093726" "Kawago, clan elder"
// Description :
"P1886919461" "Rescue Kawago"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P635406553" "Thank you, my friend. Let me tell you my tale."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3595308907" "You freed Kawago and learned about a world of shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2190352674" "Shadows, huh? The Praetorians are interested in shadows? I suppose we better look into this, {HeroName}. It could be that Kawago is right; this could be the lead that helps us free Statesman from the Praetorians."
// RandomFameString :
"P2778439076" "I hear {HeroName} rescued a whole clan of warriors from Battle Maiden!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1072062270" "We've got an emergency situation here, {HeroName}! I just got a report from a neighborhood called Faunton Park. The people there claim that their shadows are actually trying to attack them. I wouldn't be surprised to learn that the Praetorians are behind this. It's chaos over there, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to rescue those people from their shadows!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P605443466" "Rescue people from their shadows"
// SendOffString :
"P3296873416" "I can hardly believe the stories I'm hearing. People are saying that their shadows stepped right off the pavement and started to attack!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1510733990" "Rescue citizens from shadows"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3709946064" "Faunton Park is still in the grip of those strange shadows!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P3561055114" "Faunton Park"
// EntryString :
"P1041696045" "You've never heard of something as strange as what Maria Jenkins described to you. Shadows? Attacking their owners?"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1961674973" "Let the shadows be freed!"
// Script Variable CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1701128950" "You will not disrupt this ritual!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P78283242" "Terrified citizen"
// Description :
"P502445921" "citizens to rescue"
// SingularDescription :
"P2023654776" "Rescue the last citizen!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P244372024" "I heard their plans!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2000096620" "They charmed our own shadows!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1503442097" "I've never been so scared in my life!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P229895585" "What's going on here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2763029203" "Thank you, thank you, thank you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3622467573" "That was amazing, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1887112480" "I'm going to name my first child after you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3039499304" "You are the greatest!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Citizen9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3544951075" "I think they wanted us dead!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1042241267" "You saved the citizens!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P484607361" "If that citizen heard right, Black Swan may be keeping Statesman on her mysterious Shadow World. We've got to do whatever we can to locate that world, {HeroName}. The life of this town's greatest hero may well hang in the balance!"
// RandomFameString :
"P75682078" "{HeroName} saved my whole neighborhood from these horrible, walking shadows!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2830438907" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go talk to Tina Macintyre once more.</A> She's a gifted scientist, and it's just possible that she may be able to track down this Shadow World where Black Swan draws her minions from. If Tina can find it, I'd like you to go there and see if you can find out whether Statesman is actually imprisoned on that world. If he is, we've got to break him free."
// AcceptString :
"P3661318921" "Talk to Tina Macintyre about the Shadow World"
// SendOffString :
"P2339348836" "I don't really know whether we're chasing a solid lead or a wild goose. I do know we can't stop until Statesman's safe at home."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound7_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4017860087" "Talk to Tina Macintyre"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4164773176" "Tina just called. She's waiting for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1395009198" "Yes, Portal Corporation has charted no fewer than 17 different Shadow Worlds. It's certainly possible that Black Swan's home dimension is one of those. Perhaps we can narrow it down if I give you a quick scan. After all, you fought Black Swan's shadows quite recently; you may have a trace of their dimensional signature about you. <br><br>Well, here's a promising lead. I'd like you to check out dimensions Zeta Tao 7-63. I think you may find Black Swan's strange shadow minions there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound7_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2480932560" "Rescue the prisoner"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1759658083" "I need to know if that Shadow World is connected to Statesman's disappearance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P876896836" "You hate to think of anyone imprisoned on this desolate planet, even someone as brave as Statesman."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3205587882" "Black Swan"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P365909552" "The prisoner will speak, or else I will make him."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P569936366" "You will die among my shadows!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Prisoner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2978435254" "Julio Jimenez"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4110201368" "I'll tell you my story. But I'm afraid it won't make sense."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4023065407" "You rescued Black Swan's prisoner, but found no trace of Statesman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4068569122" "That Julio Jimenez sure had a disturbing story to tell. I wonder who this dark master of his actually is? That's a question we may have to revisit at some time. But for now, finding Statesman is our number one priority."
// RandomFameString :
"P1554185634" "{HeroName} rescued a prisoner from Black Swan's lair!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3191494999" "Well, that Shadow World may have been a dead end, but Portal Corporation has been scanning Praetorian Earth for some time now, and they've located a possible location where Statesman may be imprisoned. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to check out an asylum run by Mother Mayhem and her crazed henchman, Malaise.</A> If you see any sign of Statesman, report back immediately."
// AcceptString :
"P2984140985" "Check out the asylum"
// SendOffString :
"P3792681280" "Statesman and I used to adventure together, you know. If the Praetorians have done anything to him, they'll have me to deal with."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2250897597" "Defeat all villains in asylum"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P575076338" "Have you found any sign of Statesman yet? {HeroName}, if he's imprisoned in that asylum, we have to know!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4091777376" "A chittering laugh breaks off into a mournful wail."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3544190908" "Malaise"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1751996632" "Strap down Mrs. Wiggins in 104."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P415813072" "Come to see the sideshow?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1391281983" "Mother Mayhem"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P123690420" "I want to hear the patients howling by nightfall."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1374104525" "Ah, a new patient! What a wonderful surprise!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1510558849" "You defeated Mother Mayhem and Malaise, but found no sign of Statesman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2434242683" "There was no sign of Statesman in that asylum? Darn. Well, we can't give up hope yet, {HeroName}. Portal Corporation's scans picked up another likely lead; we'll try that out next."
// RandomFameString :
"P1190799753" "{HeroName}'s on a mission to find Statesman!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1507414869" "Mother Mayhem's asylum may have been a dead end, but we're going to free Statesman yet. Portal Corporation turned up another likely lead: a mystical torture chamber run by the demonic Infernal and his twisted sidekick, Diabolique. If Statesman is there, there's no doubt the Praetorians are trying to pump him for information. States won't give an inch, but I hate the thought of him in a place like that. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to comb that torture chamber for any sign of Statesman.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P885471968" "Search Infernal's torture chamber for any sign of Statesman"
// SendOffString :
"P3646536499" "Statesman is one of the greatest heroes I ever met, and I've made the acquaintance of quite a few. I can't imagine how the Praetorians managed to capture him!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2391987993" "Defeat all villains in cavern"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1079243045" "Statesman may be in Infernal's torture chamber right this minute."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1828626512" "You can't tell in this light, but it's possible that the walls are stained with blood."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3352535467" "Diabolique"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P878343225" "What new pleasures has Infernal cooked up for us?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3203792637" "You will face the terrible wrath of Infernal!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2734402751" "Infernal"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P271569407" "This is going to be an evening to remember, my pets."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P641589593" "You will rot in my dungeon forever!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2151821159" "You defeated Infernal and Diabolique, but found no sign of Statesman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3254558646" "I was really hoping that you'd find Statesman, or at least a clue to his location. I'm getting worried, {HeroName}. I won't give up until States is safely back in this dimension. But I sure wish we had some hope of finding him soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P768734294" "{HeroName}'s still looking for Statesman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3397585641" "{HeroName}, something terrible has happened! The Praetorians have invaded a Portal Corporation lab! It's that thug Marauder and his sick lieutenant, Dominatrix. There's a lot of important technology in that lab, but, even more importantly, there are half a dozen technicians. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to repel the Praetorians from that lab!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P887377033" "Repel the Praetorians from the Portal Corporation lab"
// SendOffString :
"P1554975726" "Those Praetorians may well be the greatest threat Paragon City has ever faced."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2986869367" "Defeat all villains in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P651610542" "That Portal Corporation lab is still in the hands of the Praetorians!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2243789394" "From within the lab, a man's voice calls desperately for help."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P200272913" "Dominatrix"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3119261979" "Do you remember the look on States' face the first time he saw me? Hah! What a wimp!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P408418739" "You can join your role model in a Praetorian jail!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2043434945" "Dominatrix commands a tight patrol."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1319745176" "As the Domme wishes."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P551730851" "Marauder"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2335382540" "This world and all its people will be Tyrant's!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P999912680" "You can't take me, puny hero! But, please, go ahead and try!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScientistWithClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P613835953" "Scientist"
// Description :
"P4245099803" "scientists to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P159809516" "Save the last scientist!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1846038575" "Listen! I think I can tell you where they came from!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scientist2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4115787593" "Thank goodness for heroes!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scientist3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2313236140" "You saved us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scientist4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P960559561" "That Dominatrix chick is crazy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Scientist5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1093043014" "Is that the Back Alley Brawler? Tell me it's not!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3222744276" "You expelled the Praetorians from the Portal Corporation lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4021746143" "Wow, {HeroName}, if that scientist is right, we may have finally found Statesman! You should get some friends together; I expect this rescue mission will be a doozy."
// RandomFameString :
"P3895399513" "{HeroName} stopped a Praetorian invasion at Portal Corporation!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2739388538" "According to the Portal technician who scanned Dominatrix, Statesman is being held in a cave network deep within the bowels of Praetorian Earth. They've scanned the area, and what they've learned has been immensely useful. It seems that Statesman's bonds are powered by a generator held by Tyrant himself! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can defeat Tyrant, you can free Statesman!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P160646867" "Free Statesman"
// SendOffString :
"P3944964451" "You remember how the Praetorians weren't able to use their own tech to scan States? Well, our best theory on that is that Statesman is physically so similar to Tyrant that his presence in the Praetorian dimension is never quite complete. It's as if there just isn't room for him there. The upshot is that Statesman is impervious to Praetorian technology. And it's impervious to him! He can't break out of those bonds, not on his own. You have to help him!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3904287214" "Defeat Tyrant and his minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P304900376" "Paragon City needs Statesman, {HeroName}! And Statesman needs you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4110582724" "You never dreamed that the great Statesman would someday rely on you for help. Now that the moment's here, there's no time to savor it. After all, there's a job to be done."
// Script Variable TYRANT_DISPLAY_NAME :
"P4180939546" "Tyrant"
// Script Variable TYRANT_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3441202116" "So, Statesman. How does it feel to be a prisoner?"
// Script Variable TYRANT_ATTACk_DIALOG :
"P1689496722" "Statesman will never be freed!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P3334750202" "<em t=3><em>Thank you, {HeroName}. I have been watching your career for some time. <em akimbo>I'm not surprised you've come this far. Keep fighting the good fight."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Tyrant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3750628469" "You defeated Tyrant and freed Statesman!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1788741378" "You did it, {HeroName}! You freed Statesman! I can hardly believe it's true. Can you imagine the faces of the citizens, when they see Statesman flying over their city once more? {HeroName}, I don't think I've ever been so proud!"
// RandomFameString :
"P365443497" "{HeroName} defeated Tyrant!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3974918690" "Statesman sent this face plate over for you. He said to tell you that he was glad to see Paragon City had been in good hands while he was away. Statesman isn't careless with his praise, {HeroName}; it seems pretty clear to me that he thinks the world of you."
// RandomFameString :
"P3656080599" "{HeroName} freed Statesman!"
